    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
